2026-09-24T03:10:38.7824417Z 
2026-09-24T03:10:38.7824547Z Useful when needed:
2026-09-24T03:10:38.7825040Z   dw explain                         Explain the latest change from local evidence, with no AI required
2026-09-24T03:10:38.7825786Z   dw state why ID                     Find the recorded reasons and sources behind a memory item
